Title:          SBPmixer
Version:        2.0
Entered-Date:   2022-05-30
Description:    Mixer for Sound Blaster Pro compatible cards
Summary:        Sound Blaster Pro Mixer Chip Interface command line utility to
                view and change mixer settings on compatible cards. Also
                includes, a program loadable/embeddable driver to control the
                mixer chip.
